{{#> layout title="Password Reset Request"}}
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#444444;">Hi {{username}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">A request has been made to reset the password for your account. Please click the button below to reset your password:</p>
{{> button href=resetPasswordLink label="Reset Password" padBottom="32px"}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">If you didn't make this request, please ignore this email.</p>
<p style="margin:0;">Best,<br>The Archivium Team</p>
{{/layout}}
